omfort zone and i  know that and that's sort of like a  general new year's resolution to do that  as well but that's what makes us better  either way bottom line welcome to 2018  uh i hope every video i upload this year  is better than every video from last  year and from all the previous years and  i think that's definitely possible  but other than that  thanks for watching talk to you guys the  next one  peace  [Music]

